    <string name="whitelist_info_title">Whitelist Info</string>
    <string name="whitelist_info_body">Website — Whitelisted domains are never blocked. Whitelisting a site does not whitelist the ads that the site might link to.\n\nApps — Selected apps bypass the VPN entirely and use your normal connection. All other apps will have their traffic routed through the VPN to be filtered.</string>
